  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "东坡先生，你好吗，我脚下的这片岛屿，是你人生中最心酸的地方，这是你流放之路的最后一站，海南。写给苏东坡的一封信。#读书 #苏东坡 #传统文化",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_f959190bccab511c_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 243.666667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "东坡先生你好吗？我脚下的这片岛屿是你人生中最心酸的地方，这是你流放之路上的最后一站。海南宋哲宗少盛四年，六十二岁的你被贬到海南儋州，据说在宋朝最终的罪罚就是满门抄斩。其次就是放逐海南，你甚至已经安排好了后事。到了海南，第一件事就是去做棺材。此时，你的爱妾昭云已经去世，弟弟苏辙也受到你的牵连。被贬雷州，你在岛上旧病复发，当时这里蛇虫出没，而你又被撵出住处，只能流落街头。过着食无肉病、无药居无事的悲惨生活。你在椰子树下搭了一个窝棚度日啊，岛上的黎族土著常常来接近你，你的回报是交给他们种植水稻、开发香料。你在这里广收弟子学生，你还教出了海南岛历史上第一位举人和第一位进士，你成了这座荒岛上的启蒙者。一个人可以改变一整座岛，你给一位海南的学生将唐左写诗，但只写了前两句，你说要等他考中举人，就把整首诗给补全。东坡先生，你知道吗？姜唐左后来真的考中了举人，而可惜的是，他再也等不到你剩下的几居室了。就在这一年，你结束了海南的流放生涯去世于北归的路上。在去世之前，你总结自己的一生，写下了几句诗心，似已晖之木深。如不际之舟问如平生工业黄州、惠州、儋州，儋州就是现在的海南。回首一生，你最想夸耀的并不是高居庙堂的辉煌，而竟然是你受贬谪的流离的时光。这些流浪的日子，成了你的黄金岁月，你这一生，少年丧母，青年丧妻，中年丧子被流放了大半个中国。你想不通，为什么总是不断的被流放？你不是科举电视的第二名吗？甚至你应该是第一名啊，你怎么总是被流放呢？是因为有些人觉得你有才华是他最大的障碍。你从没有想过你的潇洒会招来别人的恨，有人见不得你过得好，被贬黄州时，你说谁怕一蓑烟雨任平生？嗯，但你真的没有怕过吗？其实你是怕过的吧。当你被抓时，甚至两次投河自尽，被衙役救起，而后你突然动悟给自己起了个号。东坡，你从苏轼正式成为苏东坡。莫听穿林打叶声，何妨吟啸且徐行被贬惠州时，你说日诞荔枝三百颗，不辞常做岭南人。结果皇帝读到这句诗很生气啊，明明是在处罚你，流放你，而你却吃荔枝吃那么开心，就把你载贬到海南来。结果你到了海南，却说眼前见天下无一个不是好人，可是明明朝堂上都是要害你整你的人呢？东坡先生，我好想知道你是怎么做到如此的豁达的，你知道吗？我总是在调侃自己，明明懂得很多的道理，可是依旧过不好这一生。直到这次来到海南，想起你我才突然明白，我其实并不是真的懂得那些道理，我只是听过见过，让它经过，是你让我明白了怎么才能了悟。人生必须得在困难，处在至暗处，在人看不到的地方，在不顺意，处在在处处所谓门槛，跨不过去的就是一道坎，而跨过去的就是一扇门。今天我站在一千年之后的海南，曾经吹拂着你的海风，如今在吹拂陪着我。我会突然有一瞬间觉得自己真的走错了好多路啊。在岁月的长河中，最不缺的其中之一就是遗憾。像东坡先生，你这样的人中龙凤都举步维艰。我等榆目，又岂会一路顺遂，我会永远记得你在海南写的这句诗，世事，一场大梦，人生几度秋凉东坡先生。我想，几乎每一个中国人，都会在人生的某一个时刻与你相遇吧。东坡永谢，你来过，谢谢你，让我明白，最终能拯救自己的只有我自己。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 1590,
      "text": "东坡先生你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2070,
      "end_ms": 5370,
      "text": "我脚下的这片岛屿是你人生中最心酸的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5730,
      "end_ms": 7830,
      "text": "这是你流放之路上的最后一站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8109,
      "end_ms": 10810,
      "text": "海南宋哲宗少盛四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10930,
      "end_ms": 13150,
      "text": "六十二岁的你被贬到海南儋州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13550,
      "end_ms": 16490,
      "text": "据说在宋朝最终的罪罚就是满门抄斩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16670,
      "end_ms": 18170,
      "text": "其次就是放逐海南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18410,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "你甚至已经安排好了后事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20350,
      "end_ms": 20930,
      "text": "到了海南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20930,
      "end_ms": 22470,
      "text": "第一件事就是去做棺材。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22690,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "此时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23090,
      "end_ms": 24990,
      "text": "你的爱妾昭云已经去世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25070,
      "end_ms": 26950,
      "text": "弟弟苏辙也受到你的牵连。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26950,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "text": "被贬雷州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28070,
      "end_ms": 29815,
      "text": "你在岛上旧病复发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "当时这里蛇虫出没，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31740,
      "end_ms": 33400,
      "text": "而你又被撵出住处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33600,
      "end_ms": 34840,
      "text": "只能流落街头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 35080,
      "end_ms": 38740,
      "text": "过着食无肉病、无药居无事的悲惨生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39000,
      "end_ms": 41540,
      "text": "你在椰子树下搭了一个窝棚度日啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 41660,
      "end_ms": 44260,
      "text": "岛上的黎族土著常常来接近你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 44260,
      "end_ms": 47540,
      "text": "你的回报是交给他们种植水稻、开发香料。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47760,
      "end_ms": 49640,
      "text": "你在这里广收弟子学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 49920,
      "end_ms": 53400,
      "text": "你还教出了海南岛历史上第一位举人和第一位进士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 53600,
      "end_ms": 55740,
      "text": "你成了这座荒岛上的启蒙者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 55980,
      "end_ms": 58000,
      "text": "一个人可以改变一整座岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 58480,
      "end_ms": 60885,
      "text": "你给一位海南的学生将唐左写诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 61140,
      "end_ms": 62615,
      "text": "但只写了前两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 62940,
      "end_ms": 64200,
      "text": "你说要等他考中举人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 64200,
      "end_ms": 65645,
      "text": "就把整首诗给补全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 66090,
      "end_ms": 66815,
      "text": "东坡先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 67060,
      "end_ms": 67780,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 68060,
      "end_ms": 70265,
      "text": "姜唐左后来真的考中了举人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 70530,
      "end_ms": 71315,
      "text": "而可惜的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 71600,
      "end_ms": 73945,
      "text": "他再也等不到你剩下的几居室了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 74360,
      "end_ms": 75020,
      "text": "就在这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 75020,
      "end_ms": 79025,
      "text": "你结束了海南的流放生涯去世于北归的路上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 79550,
      "end_ms": 80330,
      "text": "在去世之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 80330,
      "end_ms": 81610,
      "text": "你总结自己的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 81610,
      "end_ms": 83760,
      "text": "写下了几句诗心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 83760,
      "end_ms": 85460,
      "text": "似已晖之木深。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 85460,
      "end_ms": 90590,
      "text": "如不际之舟问如平生工业黄州、惠州、儋州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 90790,
      "end_ms": 92135,
      "text": "儋州就是现在的海南。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 92550,
      "end_ms": 93210,
      "text": "回首一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 93210,
      "end_ms": 96265,
      "text": "你最想夸耀的并不是高居庙堂的辉煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 96560,
      "end_ms": 98860,
      "text": "而竟然是你受贬谪的流离的时光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 99160,
      "end_ms": 100240,
      "text": "这些流浪的日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 100240,
      "end_ms": 101695,
      "text": "成了你的黄金岁月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 102070,
      "end_ms": 102690,
      "text": "你这一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 102970,
      "end_ms": 103990,
      "text": "少年丧母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 103990,
      "end_ms": 104950,
      "text": "青年丧妻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 105030,
      "end_ms": 107665,
      "text": "中年丧子被流放了大半个中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 107960,
      "end_ms": 108615,
      "text": "你想不通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 108890,
      "end_ms": 110565,
      "text": "为什么总是不断的被流放？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 110930,
      "end_ms": 112910,
      "text": "你不是科举电视的第二名吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 113090,
      "end_ms": 114685,
      "text": "甚至你应该是第一名啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 114900,
      "end_ms": 116515,
      "text": "你怎么总是被流放呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 117100,
      "end_ms": 121445,
      "text": "是因为有些人觉得你有才华是他最大的障碍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 121930,
      "end_ms": 124545,
      "text": "你从没有想过你的潇洒会招来别人的恨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 124920,
      "end_ms": 126535,
      "text": "有人见不得你过得好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 127060,
      "end_ms": 127900,
      "text": "被贬黄州时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 127900,
      "end_ms": 130735,
      "text": "你说谁怕一蓑烟雨任平生？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 130990,
      "end_ms": 131240,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 131370,
      "end_ms": 132865,
      "text": "但你真的没有怕过吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 133240,
      "end_ms": 134545,
      "text": "其实你是怕过的吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 134820,
      "end_ms": 135760,
      "text": "当你被抓时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 135960,
      "end_ms": 137620,
      "text": "甚至两次投河自尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 137620,
      "end_ms": 138620,
      "text": "被衙役救起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 138700,
      "end_ms": 140880,
      "text": "而后你突然动悟给自己起了个号。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 141080,
      "end_ms": 141575,
      "text": "东坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 142020,
      "end_ms": 144355,
      "text": "你从苏轼正式成为苏东坡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 144830,
      "end_ms": 146510,
      "text": "莫听穿林打叶声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 146590,
      "end_ms": 149660,
      "text": "何妨吟啸且徐行被贬惠州时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 149660,
      "end_ms": 151440,
      "text": "你说日诞荔枝三百颗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 151440,
      "end_ms": 153105,
      "text": "不辞常做岭南人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 153390,
      "end_ms": 155345,
      "text": "结果皇帝读到这句诗很生气啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 155620,
      "end_ms": 156860,
      "text": "明明是在处罚你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 156860,
      "end_ms": 157520,
      "text": "流放你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 157540,
      "end_ms": 159360,
      "text": "而你却吃荔枝吃那么开心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 159560,
      "end_ms": 161045,
      "text": "就把你载贬到海南来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 161380,
      "end_ms": 162320,
      "text": "结果你到了海南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 162320,
      "end_ms": 165435,
      "text": "却说眼前见天下无一个不是好人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 165780,
      "end_ms": 168725,
      "text": "可是明明朝堂上都是要害你整你的人呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 169030,
      "end_ms": 169765,
      "text": "东坡先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 170010,
      "end_ms": 173405,
      "text": "我好想知道你是怎么做到如此的豁达的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 173610,
      "end_ms": 174265,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 174720,
      "end_ms": 176075,
      "text": "我总是在调侃自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 176350,
      "end_ms": 177745,
      "text": "明明懂得很多的道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 177980,
      "end_ms": 179425,
      "text": "可是依旧过不好这一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 179920,
      "end_ms": 181240,
      "text": "直到这次来到海南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 181240,
      "end_ms": 183060,
      "text": "想起你我才突然明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 183380,
      "end_ms": 186420,
      "text": "我其实并不是真的懂得那些道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 186560,
      "end_ms": 188280,
      "text": "我只是听过见过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 188560,
      "end_ms": 189420,
      "text": "让它经过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 189800,
      "end_ms": 192240,
      "text": "是你让我明白了怎么才能了悟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 192240,
      "end_ms": 193900,
      "text": "人生必须得在困难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 193900,
      "end_ms": 195280,
      "text": "处在至暗处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 195600,
      "end_ms": 197200,
      "text": "在人看不到的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 197200,
      "end_ms": 197840,
      "text": "在不顺意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 197840,
      "end_ms": 200480,
      "text": "处在在处处所谓门槛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 200740,
      "end_ms": 202280,
      "text": "跨不过去的就是一道坎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 202340,
      "end_ms": 204140,
      "text": "而跨过去的就是一扇门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 204620,
      "end_ms": 206640,
      "text": "今天我站在一千年之后的海南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 206820,
      "end_ms": 208500,
      "text": "曾经吹拂着你的海风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 208720,
      "end_ms": 210430,
      "text": "如今在吹拂陪着我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 210430,
      "end_ms": 213990,
      "text": "我会突然有一瞬间觉得自己真的走错了好多路啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 214310,
      "end_ms": 215550,
      "text": "在岁月的长河中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 215550,
      "end_ms": 217570,
      "text": "最不缺的其中之一就是遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 217990,
      "end_ms": 218890,
      "text": "像东坡先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 218890,
      "end_ms": 221270,
      "text": "你这样的人中龙凤都举步维艰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 221410,
      "end_ms": 222410,
      "text": "我等榆目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 222430,
      "end_ms": 223970,
      "text": "又岂会一路顺遂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 224690,
      "end_ms": 226950,
      "text": "我会永远记得你在海南写的这句诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 227370,
      "end_ms": 227910,
      "text": "世事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 227990,
      "end_ms": 228870,
      "text": "一场大梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 229130,
      "end_ms": 231930,
      "text": "人生几度秋凉东坡先生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 232170,
      "end_ms": 232510,
      "text": "我想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 232510,
      "end_ms": 233730,
      "text": "几乎每一个中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 233730,
      "end_ms": 236650,
      "text": "都会在人生的某一个时刻与你相遇吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 236750,
      "end_ms": 238030,
      "text": "东坡永谢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 238030,
      "end_ms": 238570,
      "text": "你来过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 238870,
      "end_ms": 239370,
      "text": "谢谢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 239370,
      "end_ms": 240165,
      "text": "让我明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f959190bccab511c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 240490,
      "end_ms": 243345,
      "text": "最终能拯救自己的只有我自己。"
    }
  ],
